(F5 T2 V3: same model as element_geometry_present_plus_displacement1
 with the default -node_start_refined: the start coordinates x 0 / 1 are
 not in geometry_quadrilateral 7, no element_geometry_present record.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
